  "body": "Auction: Cnr Tamaki Dr and St Heliers Bay Rd (Branch Office) on Wednesday 28 October 2026 at 4:30PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nElevated and set in native bush, this beautifully crafted two level home offers a relaxed Bays’ lifestyle with sunshine, privacy and timeless character. \r\n\r\nThoughtfully renovated to complement its original character, the home combines beautiful timber flooring and tropical shutters to create a casual coastal vibe.\r\n\r\nAn oversized glass front door welcomes you into the home and affords you an intriguing view of the bush beyond.\r\n\r\nThe main living level is designed for effortless entertaining with an open plan layout flowing seamlessly through bifold doors to an expansive sun-drenched deck where you can relax at the end of a busy day, your tranquility broken only by the sounds of abundant birdlife.\r\n\r\nInside, the well designed kitchen will please the family chef and is the anchor for an elegant living room and family sized dining area. \r\n\r\nOn this level you will also find the generous principal bedroom with en suite and walk through wardrobe, and a separate study nook. The bedroom opens fully to the deck.\r\n\r\nTwo further spacious bedrooms, a family bathroom, laundry and extra storge are on the lower level where you will also find a particularly expansive deck - great for entertaining larger groups and family activities. Again, these two bedrooms open to this lower deck.\r\n\r\nA double carport with ready access to the home provides convenient off street parking. \r\n\r\nThe lifestyle is equally compelling with the waterfront, and the cafes, boutique retail and library close at hand. This easy care home allows you to spend your weekends out enjoying life rather than mowing lawns!\r\n\r\nThe home is zoned for the popular schools of St Thomas, St Ignatius School and Glendowie College.\r\n\r\nWith its speedy commute to the CBD, this move-in ready home delivers an enviable combination of lifestyle, location and enduring appeal. Families, professional couples and downsizers will wish to view early.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
